WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.249 --> 00:00:03.121
(dramatic music)

00:00:03.121 --> 00:00:05.554
(banging)

00:00:05.554 --> 00:00:08.137
(Joyce grunts)

00:00:23.214 --> 00:00:25.150
- Don't you dare.

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:26.450
At least I was here!

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:29.510
- Oh, come on, Joyce, just
look around this place.

00:00:29.510 --> 00:00:30.980
All your Christmas lights,

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:31.813
what the hell am I supposed to think,

00:00:31.813 --> 00:00:32.830
you're such a great mom?

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:33.800
You're a mess!

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.370
- Maybe I am a mess, maybe I'm crazy,

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:39.000
maybe I'm out of my mind, but God help me,

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.480
I will keep these lights
up until the day I die

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:45.280
if I think there's a chance
that Will's still out there.

00:00:46.781 --> 00:00:49.614
Now, get out, get out of my house!

00:00:51.558 --> 00:00:53.528
(door bangs)

00:00:53.528 --> 00:00:54.361
- Hey, get back inside.

00:00:54.361 --> 00:00:56.112
- What, are you insane?

00:00:56.112 --> 00:00:58.500
- Look, something happens to
me, I don't make it back--

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:00.240
- Yeah, well then I'll go, you stay.

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:01.690
Are you kidding me?

00:01:01.690 --> 00:01:06.190
He's my son, Hop, my son, I'm going.

00:01:06.190 --> 00:01:09.260
You took my boy away from me.

00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:13.477
You left him in that place to die.

00:01:13.477 --> 00:01:15.003
You faked his death.

00:01:17.020 --> 00:01:20.843
We had a funeral, we buried him,

00:01:22.170 --> 00:01:24.683
and now you're asking for my help?

00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:30.403
Go to hell.

00:01:32.310 --> 00:01:36.150
Can anyone tell me what's wrong with him?

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:39.020
Can a single person in this room tell me

00:01:39.020 --> 00:01:40.773
what is wrong with my boy?

00:01:44.210 --> 00:01:46.640
What is wrong with my boy?

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:47.763
We have to kill it.

00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:52.110
I want to kill it.

00:01:52.110 --> 00:01:53.610
We need to burn it out of him.

00:01:54.620 --> 00:01:56.453
This thing has had Will long enough.

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:00.390
Let's kill the son of a bitch.

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:02.230
We have had a very long day.

00:02:02.230 --> 00:02:04.470
We have been shot at, nearly blown up,

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:07.510
walked God knows how many
miles in 100 degree heat,

00:02:07.510 --> 00:02:10.000
stole a car, all while being chased by

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:13.200
this gigantic psychopath, all so we could

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:16.290
bring him to you, because somehow,

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:18.620
you're the closest person
who speaks Russian,

00:02:18.620 --> 00:02:19.650
which I can't believe.

00:02:19.650 --> 00:02:23.410
But that doesn't matter, because
unfortunately, we're here.

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:25.990
So if you don't mind, put that thing away,

00:02:25.990 --> 00:02:29.070
stop behaving like a jackass, and ask him

00:02:29.070 --> 00:02:31.260
what he's doing that's
making my magnets fall

00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:33.250
off my damn fridge!

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:35.010
- Ma'am, I'm gonna need you to stay calm.

00:02:35.010 --> 00:02:38.320
- No, don't you dare patronize me.

00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:40.030
I don't know who you are,

00:02:40.030 --> 00:02:42.860
if you're some glorified
secretary or what,

00:02:42.860 --> 00:02:44.690
but if you don't wanna lose your job,

00:02:44.690 --> 00:02:45.870
here's what's gonna happen.

00:02:45.870 --> 00:02:48.870
When I hang up, you're
gonna get up off your ass

00:02:48.870 --> 00:02:50.150
and you're gonna go find Owens

00:02:50.150 --> 00:02:51.710
and tell him what's going on.

00:02:51.710 --> 00:02:53.850
We don't have time to talk about it,

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:54.970
and neither does he.

00:02:54.970 --> 00:02:58.270
He's gotta get to Hawkins
and he's gotta bring his men

00:02:58.270 --> 00:03:01.000
right now, do you understand me?

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:02.080
- Yes, yes ma'am.

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:04.136
- Thank you, and good day.

00:03:04.136 --> 00:03:04.969
(phone slams down)

00:03:04.969 --> 00:03:07.230
- Wait, that's right, we're on our way

00:03:07.230 --> 00:03:11.210
to rescue our children from the big bad

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:13.240
Fourth of July celebration.

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:14.770
- You know what, if you can't handle this,

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:17.520
then just turn around
and drop me off first.

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:19.050
- What are you gonna do?

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:21.310
You gonna walk back to Hawkins?

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:23.931
- I will do anything if
it gets me away from you.

00:03:23.931 --> 00:03:26.567
- Children, children, children!

00:03:26.567 --> 00:03:29.140
(circus music)

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:31.860
- Hey, Larry.

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:33.037
- Joyce.

00:03:33.037 --> 00:03:33.870
(punch thuds)

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:35.734
(Larry yells)

00:03:35.734 --> 00:03:36.820
(kick thuds)

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:39.721
(groaning)

00:03:39.721 --> 00:03:41.304
- [Man] Yeah, lady!

